Subject: [PATCH 090/144] GreatDANE: ship PrivacyInfo.xcprivacy in
 Contents/Resources (conservative data types, accurate reason codes)

- greatdane/macos/PrivacyInfo.xcprivacy: no tracking, no tracking domains. Declares stock Mozilla-service data
  (EmailAddress for an optional Mozilla account; DeviceID for the push UAID/opt-in Glean client_id; CoarseLocation
  for the region lookup; ProductInteraction/PerformanceData/OtherDiagnosticData only with opt-in data collection).
  Required-reason APIs: FileTimestamp C617.1/3B52.1/DDA9.1, SystemBootTime 35F9.1/8FFB.1, DiskSpace E174.1,
  UserDefaults CA92.1.
- greatdane/macos/PRIVACY-MANIFEST.md: per-entry rationale with source pointers.
- browser/app/Makefile.in: repackage copies it into Contents/Resources.
- browser/installer/package-manifest.in: @RESPATH@/PrivacyInfo.xcprivacy.

Prepared only. Not built, signed, notarized or published.
